      "title": "Career Opportunities",
      "description": "UConn Health Candidate Self-Service BROWSER NOT SUPPORTED - You are using an unsupported browser. Some features may not work correctly. Career Opportunities at UConn Health Session Timeout UConn Health Employment Center Your session will time out in 5 minutes.If you would like more time, please press the OK button. Toggle navigation Find Jobs Application Status Job Alerts My Profile Sign in Email Address Password Sign In Do you consent * First Name: * Last Name: Enter your Email Address: * Enter a Password: (At least 8 characters, no spaces, including one upper case letter, one special character and alphanumeric character.) * Retype Password to Confirm: CREATE AN ACCOUNT To apply for this position, choose from any of the following locations to browse and upload your resume. Choose file location My Device My Computer DropBox OneDrive GoogleDrive Select Resume: Browse.... Browse.... Browse.... USE RESUME TO CREATE AN ACCOUNT Please enter your email address: Career opportunities Explore Job Listings at UConn Health Career opportunities Explore Job Listings at UConn Health Career opportunities Explore Job Listings at UConn Health About UConn Health At UConn Health, we offer our employees opportunities within a dynamic, intellectually stimulating environment of education, research, and patient care. UConn Health is comprised of the nationally recognized Schools of Medicine and Dental Medicine, UConn John Dempsey Hospital, and UConn Medical Group.  As UConn Health continues to grow, employment opportunities are available in multiple locations throughout the state. UConn Health is an affirmative action employer, in addition to an EEO and M/F/V/PWD/PV employer. Accommodations for Applicants with Disabilities Applicants with disabilities may request reasonable accommodations under the Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA). We can explore accommodations to help applicants with the application process, during the interview as well as the hiring process itself. UConn Health engages in an interactive process with each person making a request for accommodations and reviews the requests on an individualized, case-by-case basis. Please contact 860-679-2426 to request an accommodation. Non-Discrimination Policy Commitment to Diversity, Inclusion, and a Respectful Workplace UConn is committed to providing equal employment opportunities to all its employees and applicants for employment. All applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, ethnicity, religious creed, age, sex (including pregnancy and sexual harassment), marital status, national origin, ancestry, sexual orientation, genetic information, physical or mental disabilities (including learning disabilities, intellectual disabilities, past/present history of a mental disorder), prior conviction of a crime (or similar characteristic),  veteran status, status as a victim of domestic violence, workplace hazards to reproductive systems, gender identity or expression, or other factors which cannot lawfully be the basis for employment actions, unless there is a bona fide occupational qualification. Career Opportunities at UConn Storrs and Regional Campuses Search Our Jobs Job Description Keyword: Location: --  Any Location  -- Canton Farmington Southington Storrs Torrington Department: --  Any Department  -- 10000-Dean's Office - Med 10080-Curricular Affairs 10120-Pathology & Laboratory Medicine 10145-Endocrinology 10146-Gastroenterology 10147-General Medicine 10150-Internal Medicine Assoc 10151-Nephrology 10153-Pulmonary 10154-Rheumatology 10180-Pediatrics 10200-Psychiatry 10221-Cardio Surgery 10223-General Surgery 10225-Neurosurgery 10227-Urology 10229-Surgery-Basic Sciences 10260-Obstetrics and Gynecology 10300-Orthopaedic Surgery 10320-Family Medicine 10380-Dermatology 10440-Neurology 10500-Univ Of Conn Center On Aging 10520-Neag Cancer Center (SOM) 10560-Diagnostic Imaging & Therapeutics 10600-Genetics & Genome Sciences 10663-Immunology 10760-Calhoun Cardiology Center - CCC 10840-The Cato T. Laurencin Institute 20080-Educational Clinics Admin 20181-OMFS 20182-Orthodontics 60000-Office of Health Affairs 60006-Blue Oak Retail Pharmacy 60080-Strategy and Business Development 60160-Human Resources 60161-Creative Child Care 62041-Contract and Network Management 62122-Center for Comparative Medicine 62128-Clinical and Translation Res Svcs 70020-UMG-Administration 70022-UMG-Health Information Mgmt 70029-UMG-Southington Administration 70050-UMG-Hospitalist 70059-UMG-IMA Torrington 70061-UMG-Maternal/Fetal Medicine 70081-UMG-Ears Nose And Throat 70083-UMG-Surgery - Ophthalmology 70100-UMG-Orthopedics 70161-UMG-Munson Neurology 80100-Health Information Management 80283-Epidemiology 80320-Cardiology 80740-Dermatology Clinic 81006-Interventional Psychiatry 81007-Medicine 3 Unit 81008-Surgery/Orthopedics Unit 81012-N.N.I.C.U. Unit 81013-Intensive Care Unit 81017-Postoperative Services Unit 81018-Neag Cancer Center JDH 81021-Emergency Room Unit 81022-Operating Room Unit 81024-Endoscopy Procedure Center Unit 81026-Center for Perioperative Medicine 81029-Bone Marrow Transplant Unit 81036-Medicine 4 Unit 81037-Adult Sickle Cell Unit 81039-OR-Anesthesia 81160-Case Management 81801-Solnit South 83003-Core Lab 83008-Cardiac Cath. Lab 83013-Histology 83060-Imaging Services Administration 83063-Radiology-Ct 83064-Interventional Radiology 83065-Radiology-MRI 83069-Radiology 83073-Ultrasound 83080-Rehab Services - Outpatient 83082-Rehab Services - Inpatient 83120-Pharmacy 83140-Spiritual Services Category: --  Any Category  -- Administrative Allied Health Child Care Center Faculty Health Care Hot Jobs Management Nursing Research Temporary Jobs By Category ( 168 Jobs found ) Hot jobs 5 Jobs found Administrative 14 Jobs found Allied Health 19 Jobs found Child Care Center 1 Jobs found Faculty 61 Jobs found Health Care 22 Jobs found IT No Jobs found Maintenance & Services No Jobs found Management 6 Jobs found Nursing 35